var state=AppDomain.CurrentDomain.GetData("Confectory.Recipe."+recipe) as object[]??throw new ObjectDisposedException("Recipe");lock(state[0]){if((bool)state[4])throw new ObjectDisposedException("Recipe");var resources=new System.Text.Json.Nodes.JsonArray();var amounts=new System.Text.Json.Nodes.JsonArray();foreach(string id in (string[])state[2])resources.Add(id);foreach(int value in (int[])state[3])amounts.Add(value);return new System.Text.Json.Nodes.JsonObject{["instance"]=recipe,["id"]=(string)state[1],["resources"]=resources,["deltas"]=amounts}.ToJsonString();}
